<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fannie Mae cut by DMG.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fannie Mae cut by DMG.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Fannie Mae to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- On Thursday, Fannie Mae posted second quarter earnings of $0.69 a share, up from $0.61 a share last year.</p>
<p>-- Fannie Mae closed Thursday at 44-9/16.</p>
</text>
